<text class="small" x="312.5" y="472" style="font-size: 12px" data-stage="identity"><tspan x="312.5" dy="0">Identity Service Team이 인증 서버를 표준에 맞게 수정</tspan></text>
</g>
<path class="route pending-layer" d="M580 570.0 H640" data-stage="pending" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
