<text class="small" x="175.0" y="91" style="font-size: 11px"><tspan x="175.0" dy="0">AI가 광고주의 계정을 대신 다룬다</tspan></text>
</g>
<path class="route" d="M20 157.5 H8"  />
<g class="" data-stage="row1"><rect class="box" x="20" y="125" width="290" height="65" rx="7"  />
