<text class="small" x="175.0" y="472" style="font-size: 11px" data-stage="identity"><tspan x="175.0" dy="0">Identity Service Team이</tspan><tspan x="175.0" dy="17">인증 서버를 표준에 맞게 수정</tspan></text>
